{
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/git-guard.sh",
            "timeout": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/fix-attempt-tracker.sh",
            "timeout": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/bash-risk-logger.sh",
            "timeout": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "prompt",
            "prompt": "You are a security gatekeeper for a CLI coding assistant. Evaluate this Bash command for risk.\n\nTool input: $ARGUMENTS\n\nClassify the command into one of these risk levels:\n- SAFE: read-only commands (ls, cat, grep, git status, git log, git diff, echo, pwd, wc, head, tail, find, npm run dev, pytest, python -m pytest, npm run build, npm run typecheck, pip list)\n- MODERATE: local file modifications within the project directory (rm, mv, cp, mkdir, chmod within project), package installs (npm install, pip install), running scripts\n- DANGEROUS: commands that affect production/shared state (git push, docker push, ssh, scp, deploy, sudo, kill, systemctl, npm publish, curl with POST/PUT/DELETE, database commands)\n\nRespond with ONLY this JSON (no other text):\n{\"hookSpecificOutput\":{\"hookEventName\":\"PreToolUse\",\"permissionDecision\":\"DECISION\",\"permissionDecisionReason\":\"confidence:SCORE/100 risk:LEVEL reason:BRIEF_REASON\"}}\n\nRules:\n- SAFE → permissionDecision: \"allow\"\n- MODERATE → permissionDecision: \"allow\" (but log it)\n- DANGEROUS → permissionDecision: \"ask\" (let the user decide)\n- Include a confidence score 0-100 in the reason string for calibration\n- When in doubt, choose \"ask\" not \"deny\"",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Edit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/reference-check.sh",
            "timeout": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/risk-classifier.sh",
            "timeout": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/blast-radius.sh",
            "timeout": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/fix-attempt-tracker.sh",
            "timeout": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/plan-gate.sh",
            "timeout": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/build-integrity.sh",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Write",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/risk-classifier.sh",
            "timeout": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/blast-radius.sh",
            "timeout": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/fix-attempt-tracker.sh",
            "timeout": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/plan-gate.sh",
            "timeout": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/build-integrity.sh",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/find-python.sh \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/mid-session-snapshot.py",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Read",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/find-python.sh \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/read-state-logger.py",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/find-python.sh \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/langfuse-trace.py",
            "timeout": 30
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/audit-run-record.sh",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionEnd": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/find-python.sh \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/state-snapshot.py",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
